        126.58,
        448.22
      ],
      "text": "The instant revision has been filed by M/s Victor Component Systems\nPvt. Ltd. challenging the demand notice dated 27-06-2023 issued by the\nRespondent Authority, whereby time extension charges have been levied. The\nRevisionist does not deny that the time extension charges are payable by him.\nHis only prayer is limited to the fact that the time extension charges should\nbe applicable from the outer limit for construction as mentioned in the lease\ndeed. It is a settled position of law that once a binding contract is entered\nbetween the parties, one party cannot unilaterally alter the conditions of the\ncontract."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 3,
      "poly": [
        126.34,
        460.93,
        523.08,
        460.93,
        523.08,
        517.29,
        126.34,
        517.29
      ],
      "text": "The Respondent Authority agrees to this contention of the Revisionist.\nThe Revision is disposed of with a direction to the Authority to recalculate |\nthe time extension charges as per the conditions mentioned in the lease deed."
    },
    {
